{
  "title": "CloudFront · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "사용자와 가까운 위치에서 웹 콘텐츠를 전달합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>CloudFront</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#guide-1\">캐시에서 콘텐츠를 전달하는 과정</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#guide-2\">갱신과 접근 보호</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>09 / 62</span></div><h1>CloudFront</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>CloudFront는 <strong>웹 콘텐츠를 사용자와 가까운 위치에서 전달하는 콘텐츠 전송 네트워크(CDN)</strong>입니다. 이미지나 영상 같은 파일을 가까운 곳에 캐시하면 응답 시간을 줄이고 원본 서버의 부하도 낮출 수 있습니다.</p><p>콘텐츠의 실제 보관 장소를 오리진<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>으로 지정하고 배포를 구성합니다. S3, 로드 밸런서, HTTP 서버 등을 원본으로 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"distribution-and-origin\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cache-behaviors\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cache-policy-and-cache-key\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ttl-and-invalidation\"></span><h2>캐시에서 콘텐츠를 전달하는 과정</h2><p>사용자 요청이 도착하면 캐시에서 사용할 수 있는 응답을 찾습니다. 없거나 만료됐다면 오리진에서 가져와 사용자에게 전달하고 설정에 따라 보관합니다.</p><p>경로별 캐시 동작과 캐시 키를 정합니다. 쿼리 문자열, 쿠키, 헤더 중 무엇을 캐시 구분에 사용할지에 따라 재사용률과 사용자별 응답의 정확성이 달라집니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"origin-access-control\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"signed-urls-and-signed-cookies\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"tls-waf-and-geo-restriction\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cloudfront-functions-and-lambda-edge\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"origin-shield-and-logging\"></span><h2>갱신과 접근 보호</h2><p>콘텐츠를 바꿀 때는 파일명에 버전을 붙이거나 필요한 캐시를 무효화할 수 있습니다. 로그인 사용자 전용 응답은 공유 캐시에 잘못 섞이지 않도록 정책을 정합니다.</p><p>비공개 S3 원본에는 OAC로 접근을 제한하고, 사용자 접근에는 서명된 URL이나 쿠키를 사용할 수 있습니다. 도메인의 HTTPS 인증서와 WAF도 연결해 구성합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>CloudFront의 캐시 처리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>사용자 요청</strong><span>가까운 전송 위치로 접속</span></li><li><strong>캐시 확인</strong><span>유효한 응답이 있으면 전달</span></li><li><strong>오리진 조회</strong><span>없으면 가져와 캐시</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">모든 요청이 원본 서버까지 도달하지 않도록 자주 사용하는 응답을 재사용합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>제품 이미지는 비공개 S3 버킷에 보관하고 CloudFront로 전달합니다. 파일명에 버전을 넣어 새 이미지가 배포될 때 이전 캐시와 구분합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>오리진</strong> — CloudFront가 콘텐츠를 가져오는 원본 저장소나 서버입니다. 캐시의 원본 역할을 합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/Introduction.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon CloudFront? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/private-content-restricting-access-to-s3.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Restrict access to an Amazon S3 origin ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q003/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q003\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q003\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q003</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q003/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to reduce static image download latency for users worldwide and lower requests to its origin server. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Multi-AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS snapshots</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">엣지</a>에 콘텐츠를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a>해 사용자 가까이 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">Edge Location</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q082\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q082\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q082</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q082/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 provides DNS, CloudFront delivers content, and S3 stores objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 performs HTTP path-based load balancing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 caches S3 objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront grants IAM roles</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 응답과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a> 캐싱, 객체 저장은 각 서비스의 다른 역할이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,1\" data-question=\"Q090\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q090\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q090</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q090/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO services should be considered to mitigate malicious web requests and DDoS attacks in front of CloudFront?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q090\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Shield</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q090\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q090\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q090\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q090\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DMS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>는 웹 요청 규칙, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">Shield</a>는 DDoS <span class=\"full-name\">(Distributed Denial of Service)</span> 보호에 중점을 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q017\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,3\" data-question=\"Q083\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q083\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q083</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs to access only S3. Which TWO components reduce NAT usage and internet exposure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Configure the subnet's route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an Elastic IP address to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Require a default route to an internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Create an S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow inbound access from 0.0.0.0/0</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, D</strong> · 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 적절한 라우트 연결을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 접근에 공인 주소나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>가 필수는 아니다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/\">이전 용어 <b>CloudFormation</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">다음 용어 <b>CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
